#: includes/admin-pages.php:365
msgid ""
"Automatically inject the filter bar into archive/blog pages for selected "
"post types (no shortcode needed)."
msgstr ""
"Filterleiste automatisch in Archiv-/Blog-Seiten für ausgewählte "
"Beitragstypen einbinden (kein Shortcode erforderlich)."

#: includes/admin-pages.php:388
msgid ""
"Maximum number of active filter groups at once. Higher values increase URL "
"complexity."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl gleichzeitig aktiver Filtergruppen. Höhere Werte erhöhen die "
"URL-Komplexität."

#: includes/admin-pages.php:412
msgid ""
"Maximum number of terms that can be selected within a single filter group. "
"When the limit is reached, all other terms in that group are visually "
"disabled until a selection is removed. Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl wählbarer Begriffe pro Filtergruppe. Ist das Limit erreicht, "
"werden alle anderen Begriffe dieser Gruppe visuell deaktiviert, bis eine "
"Auswahl entfernt wird. 0 = kein Limit."

#. translators: 1: example filter URL
#: includes/admin-pages.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The URL segment used for filter URLs (default: \"filter\"). Example: /blog/"
"%s/category/tag/"
msgstr ""
"Das URL-Segment für Filter-URLs (Standard: \"filter\"). Beispiel: /blog/%s/"
"kategorie/tag/"

#: includes/admin-pages.php:443
msgid ""
